  "$comment": [
    "The CI families of docs/adr/0013-run-a-targeted-pull-request-ci-and-the-heavy-jobs-before-a-release.md, read by",
    ".github/scripts/ci-plan.sh, which fails the plan when a project under src/ belongs to no family here, or to two, or",
    "a project of the unit suite to none. coverage-modules.sh reads the projects, RuntimeClosingTests the projects of its",
    "own family, which tests/UnitTests.props embeds; codecov.yml's flags are generated from them (ci-plan.sh",
    "--codecov-flags).",
    "families.<name>.train: its release train (docs/adr/0012-version-the-packages-in-two-trains-independently-of-the-frameworks.md).",
    "families.<name>.tests: its project of the unit suite, tests/<tests>/<tests>.csproj, which a change to any of its",
    "inputs selects, through dotnet-affected: its own files, the sources it links, what it references and imports. One",
    "per family, and every project of the suite is one family's.",
    "families.<name>.projects: the projects under src/, by folder name. Each is in exactly one family, whose project",
    "of the unit suite tests it, and whose RuntimeClosingTests reads the IL of each but those no application loads."
